  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad Civil Society Project in Tigray region (EECMY DASSC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative centers on fostering sustainable economic development, enhancing food security, and promoting climate and environmental stewardship. By empowering local communities with resources and knowledge, the project aims to build resilience, reduce vulnerability, and advance environmental sustainability. It is a comprehensive effort to improve livelihoods while ensuring responsible management of natural resources for future generations.</narrative>
  </description>
